# Next.js React Boundaries

- Use App Router conventions and keep pages server-rendered unless browser APIs are required.
- Add `"use client"` only to interactive components or components that depend on client-only libraries.
- Keep portfolio calculations in `src/lib/portfolio`, not inside React components.
- Pass typed, serializable data from server components into client components.
- Prefer small presentational components over broad stateful containers.
- Avoid fetching or recalculating the same portfolio data from multiple UI layers.
